<div class="page-heading stock-heading"><div><div class="breadcrumb-line">Home <span>&rsaquo;</span> Stock / Parts <span>&rsaquo;</span> <b>Stock List</b></div><h1>Stock / Parts</h1><p>Manage and track all stock items and parts.</p></div><div class="stock-heading-actions"><a href="index.php?page=admin&amp;section=stock-restock" class="btn btn-light">+ Restock Item</a><a href="index.php?page=admin&amp;section=stock-add" class="btn btn-danger">+ Add New Item</a></div></div>
